OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with good clear spells through
OL,7,Fthe evening. Cloud builds late in the
OL,8,Fnight with the odd spot of rain in the
OL,9,Ffar west, mainly over the Derbyshire
OL,10,Fhills by dawn. Winds easing slowly.
OL,11,FTemperatures near average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FCloudy to start with patchy
OL,14,Frain developing, mostly in the west.
OL,15,FCloud breaking to leave a partly
OL,16,Fcloudy afternoon with sunny spells for
OL,17,Fmost. Mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
